$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Ground";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Halcyon II" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Dusk" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle each other for control of the ancient Wall that seperates the Two bases from one another.  The Huge Structure was built by a primal tribe that live here centuries before.  Take the 3 towers to score 12 points a second and for bombing rights with 5 different mortar turrets.  Find the Secret Tower switch to gain even more points. <f1> Map by: [HvC]Leviathan";
